# React patterns

## Render = f(props, state)

Derive values during render. Do not sync derived state with `useEffect`.

## Container / presentational

- Route/page components: data loading, wiring
- Presentational components: props in, JSX out — no direct Supabase calls

## Data fetching

| Need | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Server/cache, mutations | TanStack Query |
| Form state | React Hook Form |
| Local UI | `useState` |

## Lists

Stable `key` from ids — never array index for reorderable lists.

## Composition

Prefer `children` and small focused components over deep prop drilling. Use Radix/shadcn primitives already in the project.

## Error boundaries

Wrap async/query error UI at route level where user-facing failures need recovery.

